### 1. Create (Moderator)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/v1/article/moderator
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Yangilik sarlavhasi",
  "description": "Maqola haqida qisqacha ma'lumot",
  "content": "Maqolaning to'liq matni",
  "regionId": 1,
  "categoryId": 1,
  "articleTypeIds": [1, 2],
  "tags": ["siyosat", "yangilik"],
  "moderatorId": 1
}

### 2. Update (Moderator)
PUT http://localhost:8081/api/v1/article/moderator/REPLACE_WITH_ARTICLE_UUID
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Yangilangan sarlavha",
  "description": "Yangilangan qisqacha ma'lumot",
  "content": "Yangilangan maqola matni",
  "sharedCount": 0,
  "regionId": 1,
  "categoryId": 1,
  "articleTypeIds": [1, 2],
  "tags": ["siyosat", "yangilik"]
}

### 3. Delete (Moderator)
DELETE http://localhost:8081/api/v1/article/moderator/REPLACE_WITH_ARTICLE_UUID

### 4. Publish (Publisher)
PUT http://localhost:8081/api/v1/article/moderator/REPLACE_WITH_ARTICLE_UUID/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "PUBLISHED",
  "publisherId": 2
}

### 5. Unpublish (Publisher)
PUT http://localhost:8081/api/v1/article/moderator/REPLACE_WITH_ARTICLE_UUID/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "NOT_PUBLISHED"
}

### 6. Get by id and language
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/article/REPLACE_WITH_PUBLISHED_ARTICLE_UUID
Accept-Language: uz

### 7. Get last 5 by types
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/article/types/latest?typeIds=1,2

### 8. Get last 3 by types
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/article/types/latest-three?typeIds=1,2

### 9. Get last 8 excluding ids
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/article/latest-except?ids=REPLACE_WITH_ARTICLE_UUID

### 10. Get last 4 by types excluding article
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/article/types/latest-except-article?typeIds=1,2&articleId=REPLACE_WITH_ARTICLE_UUID

### 11. Get 4 most-read articles
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/article/most-read

### 12. Get last 4 by tag (move given article to the end)
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/article/tags/siyosat/latest?lastArticleId=REPLACE_WITH_ARTICLE_UUID

### 13. Get last 5 by types and region
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/article/types/latest-by-region?typeIds=1,2&regionKey=tashkent

### 14. Get articles by region (pagination)
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/article/regions/tashkent?page=0&size=20

### 15. Get last 5 by category
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/article/categories/uzbekistan/latest

### 16. Get articles by category (pagination)
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/article/categories/uzbekistan?page=0&size=20

### 17. Increase view count
POST http://localhost:8081/api/v1/article/REPLACE_WITH_ARTICLE_UUID/view

### 18. Increase share count
POST http://localhost:8081/api/v1/article/REPLACE_WITH_ARTICLE_UUID/share

### 19. Filter articles (Publisher)
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/article/filter?id=REPLACE_WITH_ARTICLE_UUID&title=yangilik&regionId=1&categoryId=1&createdDateFrom=2026-01-01T00:00:00&createdDateTo=2026-12-31T23:59:59&publishedDateFrom=2026-01-01T00:00:00&publishedDateTo=2026-12-31T23:59:59&moderatorId=1&publisherId=2&status=PUBLISHED&page=0&size=20
